@@ -198,6 +198,11 @@
 *-r, --line-uses-ring*
 	Use the ring color for the line between the inside and ring.
 
+*--ring-idle-color* <rrggbb[aa]>
+	Sets the color of the ring of the indicator while idle. Without it the
+	idle ring uses *--ring-color*. *--inside-idle-color*, *--line-idle-color*
+	and *--text-idle-color* give the same treatment to the other parts.
+
 *--ring-color* <rrggbb[aa]>
 	Sets the color of the ring of the indicator when typing or idle.
 
